 "applies_to": "Marvair MAH1018A-1060A, MGH1072A, MAH2024A-2060A and MGH2072A wall-mount air conditioners with the electronic control board (I&O manual rev. 7).",
 "summary": "Marvair MAH and MGH packaged wall-mount air conditioners (electronic equipment shelters and process control rooms) carry an electronic control board with two RJ11 Modbus RTU ports. Over Modbus the board accepts thermostat calls, reports switch, relay and sensor states and an alarm word, and exposes fan-speed, economizer and calibration settings.",
